# Worst Programming Gore

This is a collection of the worst programming ideas.

## Contributing

1. Fork it
2. Choose a topic and the language directory. If it doesn't exist, create it.
3. Try to make your code tiny enough, they only shall show a idea and not a complete masterpiece.
	However the program have to run! Every langauge-directory have their own requirements and guidelines you have to follow.
4. follow the language-directory's README.md
5. Create a pull request
